            <span class="text-xs font-bold text-[#7B61FF] uppercase">Australian Minimum Drawdown</span>
            <h4 class="text-base font-bold text-white group-hover:text-[#7B61FF] transition-colors">Australia Super Minimum Drawdown Calculator</h4>
            <p class="text-xs text-slate-400">Calculate minimum annual drawdown percentages for account-based super pensions and plan drawdown rates that optimise Age Pension entitlement.</p>
          </a>
          <a href="/capital-gains-tax-calculator/australia/" class="p-5 rounded-xl bg-[#0A0F1D] border border-[#1E294B] hover:border-[#00F5D4]/40 transition-all space-y-2 group">
            <span class="text-xs font-bold text-[#00F5D4] uppercase">Australian Tax Planning</span>
            <h4 class="text-base font-bold text-white group-hover:text-[#00F5D4] transition-colors">Australia Capital Gains Tax Calculator</h4>
            <p class="text-xs text-slate-400">Estimate ATO CGT on investment sales and understand how realised capital gains affect your Age Pension income test assessment.</p>
          </a>
        </div>
      </section>
    </div>
  </main>
</Layout>
